                "text": "The Republican Speaker of the House has no strategy, plan or clue about how to end the government shutdown. While he refuses to negotiate or even call Congress back into session, millions of Americans are on the verge of losing their health insurance.\n\nMeanwhile, Donald Trump is offering $20B to bail out the far-right government in Argentina but won\u2019t spend another dime on healthcare for Americans. \n\nThe Republican plan for America seems to be needless suffering.",
