                "text": "This morning I shared my story about finding out I had cancer.\n\nAs a cancer patient, I know treatment is expensive. For many Americans, having health insurance is the difference between life and death. \n\nThat\u2019s why I\u2014and so many Democrats\u2014are fighting so hard to protect healthcare subsidies for millions of Americans. \n\nThank you to @AACI_Cancer for the kind recognition of my work. \n\nHere\u2019s my story.",
